  "content": "\n\n<ul>\n<li>我帶著大家強烈要求的資源包回來了，可搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a> 使用。</li>\n<li>需求模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a></li>\n<li>資源包僅在有人要求更新，且配合 Fresh 的更新時才會進行更新。</li>\n<li>支援所有版本。&nbsp;</li>\n<li>自 1.21.5 版本起，請使用 0.2 版。</li>\n<li>感謝大家持續關注本專案的開發動態。</li>\n<li>圖示專案合作項目：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-xaeros\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Icon Xaero's</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-journey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Icon Journey</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>支持我：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GodKyo98\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CzUp3Ee.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fgBP65uzSsM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/889524360992403506/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p>\n<h2><strong>支援資源包：</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-extensions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations Extensions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-skeleton-physics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Skeleton Physics</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
